Photorealistic sprite sheet of cyberpunk neon music notes, viewed perfectly straight-on, on a pure flat black background. Exactly six separate objects in one evenly spaced horizontal row, none touching, each fully visible with generous black space around it, all the same height: 1 a single eighth note, 2 two beamed eighth notes, 3 a quarter note, 4 two beamed sixteenth notes, 5 a half note with hollow head, 6 a single sixteenth note. Each is made of bent glass neon tube, glowing electric cyan with a hot magenta glow at the note head, like a neon bar sign. Consistent style and lighting across all six. Crisp focus. No staff lines, no text, no numbers, no labels, no wall, no mounting hardware, no watermark.
